<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Licences des composants tiers / Third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #8884; border-radius: 6px; }
  ul.used { columns: 2; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Licences des composants tiers / Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>Composants Rust compilés dans le moteur web (crate <code>filmcraft-web</code>, cible <code>wasm32-unknown-unknown</code>), relevés par cargo-about.
Rust components compiled into the web engine (crate <code>filmcraft-web</code>, target <code>wasm32-unknown-unknown</code>), collected by cargo-about.</p>
<h2>Vue d'ensemble / Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Textes / Texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
  <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
  <ul class="used">
  {{#each used_by}}
    <li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
